		{
			dependencies: ["640C90A0767F97C4"]
			description: [
				"After exploring the caves of this floating islands, I've found an intact portal to the End! How wonderful!"
				""
				"&4I'm growing suspicious of the reason for the cracking of the portals in our world. Something similar happened to the Moon Cultists when their connection to limbo was lost. I suspect a higher power is responsible."
				""
				"A higher power? Some sort of god?"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "0AA4D0CCC184FAB7"
			rewards: [{
