		{
			description: [
				"I am done defeating the sinful legends of the macabre lands. Nothing can stand in my way anymore, whether it be hunters, sins or false gods. Actually, there is one creature from legends that I should find. It was said in Eleonore's Travels that many, many years ago, adventurers ventured to find the Enderdragon and challenge it."
				""
				"&4You might find a portal in an ancient stronghold. You might have to venture beyond the lands of Red Barar to find a grand stronghold. They were not built by humans, but rather by an unknown ancient civilization."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&o&7Notes from Eleonore's Travels, Tome V"
				""
				"&fLeft behind by an ancient civilization that has been theorized to be the Endermen's ancestors, underground Strongholds are sprawling mazes of fortifications."
				""
				"&fThey house important End portals to enter the End. Be warned that the guardian dragon of the End is not friendly to outsiders and is especially dangerous."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "171FDA40D98FA659"
			rewards: [
