			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["171FDA40D98FA659"]
			description: [
				"Curses be foiled! The portal is completely cracked. I thought these were said to be completely unbreakable."
				""
				"&4Unbreakable to human hands, perhaps. There are always tricks to fool nature into breaking any material. This is most disapointing. How about you head to some of the forsaken sanguine lands? There might be some ancient artefacts that were once retrieved by sanguine ancestors."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"And these were not looted by the invaders?"
				""
				"&4The forsaken lands are cold. Extremely cold. This isn't an issue for sanguines, but humans prefer not to venture into cold areas. I believe some expeditions wiped out the inhabitants of these lands but they could not linger any longer."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "6353A090E01229D8"
