		{
			dependencies: ["7E76C7368365FAD4"]
			description: [
				"The suitcase sucked me into... a place. Where am I?"
				""
				"&6&oThis realm is not supposed to exist. This timeline was not planned. What kind of trickery is this?"
				""
				"What was that whisper?"
				""
				"&4I can't hear, young dummy. I'm a sentient book."
				""
				"That whisper sounded like it came from the book."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"There seem to be people on this island who are as surprised as me. Let me go talk to them."
				""
				"..."
				""
				"They also don't come from this world, how odd. There's apparently a most deadly storm that is now ever-present that they brought with them. "
